was running late. Then the doorbell rang, and Judo found Eliana standing there alone. The teen told him she and Elisa had become separated at the church. Eliana assumed Elisa had returned home without her, and was surprised to learn she wasn't there. Concerned, Judo walked towards the city centre whilst keeping an eye out for his sister, before arriving to the Church of the Holy Trinity. The surrounding area was busy with crowds of people, but there was no sign of Elisa. As 2pm approached, and Judo and Elisa still hadn't arrived for lunch in Tito, the rest of the claps family decided to leave the food they had prepared and make the brief

