00:10:33.000 --> 00:11:38.000
the priest, Father Dominico Sabia, known as Don Mimmi. Don Mimmi had left after mass that afternoon to attend the spa retreat for the next few days. That night, Gildor, Luciano and their friends stayed up until the early hours, combing the streets on foot and in cars, desperately searching for any sign of Elisa. Meanwhile, Antonio and Filomena sat by the phone, desperately willing their daughter to contact them. The phone rang off the hook with calls from concerned friends, relatives, townspeople and journalists, but there was no word from Elisa. Upon answering the phone on several occasions, the claps were simply met with a long, eerie silence. The following day, Monday, September 13, police began taking Elisa's disappearance more seriously,

