00:22:27.000 --> 00:23:20.000
as there were elements of her story that didn't quite add up, and she changed her version of events often. One witness had reported seeing Elisa riding passenger on Eliana's moped near the claps home at approximately 12.30pm on the day she went missing, and even described the very clothing the two teenagers had been wearing. Eliana strongly denied this sighting, insisting she hadn't taken her moped out that day. In addition, it was her boyfriend's mother who had tipped police off to Danilo Restivo's alleged disturbing haircutting habits. Investigators were now considering the possibility the claim was a ploy to deflect attention from Eliana, just like the false sighting of Elisa in Rome. If the witness sighting of Elisa riding

